# SPA fallback: any route not matched by a static file or a Pages Function
# under /api/* (those are matched first, before this file is consulted) gets
# index.html, so React Router can handle it client-side. Explicit rather
# than relying on Cloudflare Pages' implicit framework-preset behavior,
# which is tied to recognizing specific presets and isn't something to trust
# silently applying to this custom Vite setup.
/*    /index.html   200
